OL,3,GNEWSAComplaints to Stormont watchdog
OL,4,Aincrease for second year
OL,5,
OL,6,FComplaints to the Northern Ireland
OL,7,FAssembly's standards watchdog have
OL,8,Fincreased for the second year in a row.
OL,10,FA total of 161 complaints were made to
OL,11,Fthe Assembly Commissioner for Standards
OL,12,Fin 2025-26, compared to 149 in the
OL,13,Fprevious year.
OL,15,FA controversy over a Stormont
OL,16,Fminister's social media post was the
OL,17,Fsubject of 65 complaints.
